<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Little action in late trading.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Little action in late trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Few stocks were moving in either direction after the bell on Friday, traders said.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said session one volume was 28,100, compared to Thursday's 4,400. Session two volume was 990,661, while on Thursday it was 2,508,350.</p>
